    "Id": "chassisdef_delphyne_DLP-2",
    "Name": "Delphyne",
    "Details": "The Delphyne was developed by Clan Blood Spirit and Clan Fire Mandrill. Basing the design on the lessons learned from producing the Minotaur, the Delphyne is one of the most effective heavy ProtoMechs. This version removes some armor and the Medium Pulse Laser to carry a pair of ER Micro Lasers in the arms and twin SRM-3 launchers in the torso\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapons - Laser</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.984</color></b>",
